  "open_interest is present on 98.1% of chain rows (0 of 529 tickers have no column at all). liquidity_ok REFUSES when a threshold is set and the field is missing or NaN, so every one of the other 1.9% is barred from entry -- on data availability, not on liquidity. The OI store reaches near-full coverage only from 2024-08; the `live` tier starts there for this reason. Visible in the refusal counts as entry_gated_illiquid.",
  "earnings calendar knows 528 of 529 universe names; the other 1 read as UNKNOWN and in_blackout ALLOWS on unknown. This is identical to what the live bot does with the same file, so it is faithful rather than a divergence -- but it is not full protection."
